WEBVTT

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:07.980
I worked so hard again today.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:09.940
I'm so hungry.

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.240
Something smells good.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:18.170
Ooh, leftovers!

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.330
How considerate of you.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:33.800
Th... This soup!

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.140
It's rich in flavor but has a brilliant color, and
its aftertaste is refreshing without being bitter.

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:42.560
It mixes wonderfully with the firm texture of the noodles, resulting in exquisite harmony!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:52.330
The fragrance gently tickles the nose and the flavors spread in the mouth, complementing each other yet remaining distinct.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.610
It's the Chateaubriand of ramen...

00:00:54.610 --> 00:00:56.410
No, the Romanée-Conti!

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.910
Who made this ramen?!

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:08.280
It's starting!

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.160
Shiki, your ramen's delicious!

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:56.950
Really?

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:57.790
Yep!

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.910
That's because you aren't familiar with everyday food.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.840
There's all sorts of food I'd like you to try...

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.780
I know!

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.150
I know this great okonomiyaki restaurant, so let's go eat there sometime.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:11.170
What's okonomiyaki?

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:14.420
Eh? You don't know?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.820
Uh... Okonomiyaki, huh?

00:03:17.820 --> 00:03:19.920
It has squid and pork in it.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:25.540
You mix it all up, and then cook it yourself on an iron plate.

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:27.810
That sounds really delicious!

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.920
I know, right? Cooking it yourself is the point.

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:36.650
It's a dish you can prepare at home easily, but being
selective with the ingredients makes it taste really good.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.730
Selective!

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.090
Let's go have some next time.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.530
That's what Shiki said...

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:45.700
But it's always Shiki making me food
and never the other way round.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.530
I'd like to make him something for a change...

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:53.830
Come to think of it, I've never cooked before.

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:57.440
Tohno-kun, I made curry!

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.470
...curry... <i>curry</i> ...

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:02.440
If Ciel can do it, there no reason I can't.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:15.560
Delicious food is made from the finest ingredients!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.110
Miss.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:22.530
You'll catch a cold dressed like that.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.570
But I'm not even human!

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:33.780
Let's see... I'm pretty sure there's squid in it...

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:41.980
I caught a lot.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.090
I'll start by tasting them.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:53.130
This one's pretty tasteless.

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:55.780
Wanna try too, Ren?

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.860
This one's too tough...

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.370
This one doesn't have much flavor.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.240
Th... This one!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:09.450
This rich flavor and soft fleshiness!

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:12.500
This squid's one in a million!

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:17.790
I'm one step closer to making delicious okonomiyaki now!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.130
Okay...

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:24.880
I managed to get high-quality squid, but what about the pork?

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:28.290
I can't just use pork from anywhere.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:32.890
Beast professor walking by!

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:35.720
Well well, if it isn't the True Ancestor princess.

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:37.900
Wait.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.560
Beast professor.

00:05:39.790 --> 00:05:40.880
Beast...

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:43.150
Pigs... are beasts!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:45.630
Give me your beasts!

00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:47.150
Wai- What?!

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.660
Isn't that a cute little piglet?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.800
It's oinking so much, too!

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:55.410
Oink more, oink more!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:05.500
I'm kind of touched that Arcueid's taking this so seriously...

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:07.680
She kind of looks good in an apron, too...

00:06:08.290 --> 00:06:09.800
It's done, Shiki!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.220
Arcueid's special okonomiyaki!

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:14.610
Ooh, how wild!

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:15.930
And that's not even squid.

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.370
Handmade food, huh?

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:23.320
There's no secret ingredient better than love.

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.360
It's priceless.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:28.900
That would mean nothing's more expensive than free.

00:06:32.150 --> 00:06:34.830
The next section is an adult love story.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:42.210
I just wanted to find happiness as a woman.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.820
Master.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.110
No, Soichiro-sama.

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:54.470
I'm not actually that strong.

00:06:55.630 --> 00:06:59.440
I'm actually a really weak woman!

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:04.040
I can't live without you!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:04.980
Caster!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:07.050
Please, hold me tight!

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.360
You've had it tough.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.370
I'll protect you from now on.

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.200
I love you...

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.630
Soichiro-sama!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:21.120
Just kidding.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.690
Though I do want to fly into your arms like they do in melodramas.

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:30.590
Caster.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.970
It's almost time.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.640
I'm going.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:39.640
Because I get scared of it all just by looking at your face...

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:43.150
I walk a little distance from you.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.500
Um... What about tonight?

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:46.730
I'll be late.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:47.650
I see.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.430
Um...!

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.440
I made this.

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:54.240
What's this?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.050
It's a handmade charm!

00:07:56.050 --> 00:07:58.800
It wards off disasters and brings you good luck!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:00.250
Hmm. I see.

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.800
See you later.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:11.010
How many more times must I take the blame in order to keep my current happiness?

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:15.050
That day, for the first time in my life, I felt that God exists.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.370
How much longer must I remain soiled?

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.370
You saw him off?

00:08:24.380 --> 00:08:28.590
So an estranged flower is prettier than any peony or lily.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:29.900
How admirable.

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:32.240
You don't seem to know your place.

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:34.640
You want me to pry your ribs open?

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:35.920
Don't be so mad!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:36.950
You'll get more wrinkles.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:39.790
How dare you!

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.040
Congratulations!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.670
You're Niconico Shopping Street's 100th customer today!

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:49.710
You just won the top prize: a trip to Hawaii!

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:54.090
As a co-prize, you get three bags of rice and one year's worth of gift vouchers!

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.760
Ah, that's my suitcase with 10 million yen inside!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:00.190
Here's ten percent of it as thanks!

00:09:00.190 --> 00:09:01.970
Thank you so much!

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.560
Thank you so much!

00:09:07.560 --> 00:09:10.900
He seems to be Caster's Master.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.480
Maybe I'll go make sure-

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.500
Lightning suddenly struck the police station!

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:19.050
It fried a man in full-body tights.

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:20.200
A rubberman!

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.150
Shirou.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.390
That aside, I'm hungry.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:25.600
Let's have dinner.

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.580
Sheesh, you're a real glutton, Saber.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.760
Even if you're my Master, I can't possibly ignore what you just said!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.760
Saber's so cute!

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:36.950
So cute, so cute, so cute!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.310
She's so tiny and strong and hungry!

00:09:39.310 --> 00:09:42.390
I have to capture her no matter what.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:43.770
Once I have her...

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.200
Maid clothes!

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.150
Frilly dress!

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:47.010
Gothic loli!

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.830
I'll dress her up all I want every day!

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.690
You fox!

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:53.700
I'm reporting this to Soichiro-nii!

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:56.320
I don't know what you were making such a
ruckus over, but I bet it's something dodgy!

00:09:58.360 --> 00:10:01.250
And why would I listen to the words of a little boy?

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.420
Go study in your room, glasses-in-law.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.860
I can't let that pass! Hah!

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.540
Besides, those elf ears are dodgy anyw-

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.790
So I'm dodgy now?

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:29.310
I have to be a pure woman in front of Soichiro-sama.

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:33.760
Otherwise, there's nothing else I have as a woman.

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.010
I don't want to fail anymore.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.870
I don't want to lose anything else.

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.700
Please, let me...

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:46.450
Take a good look at this fox's true colors!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.710
Little boy!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.080
Soichiro-nii, look!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.340
Soichiro... sama...

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.760
Look! These are the fox's true colors!

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.790
Soichiro-sama.

00:11:09.880 --> 00:11:12.240
I'm this kind of woman. I...

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:13.580
Don't worry.

00:11:15.810 --> 00:11:17.780
I have something for you.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:20.280
It's a little late, but...

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:24.390
I wanted to get you something right.

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:30.160
S... Soichiro-sama?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:34.150
Think about it, Soichiro-

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.890
I may be this kind of woman...

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.380
But is it really okay for me to be happy?

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.960
Let's go on a vacation this Spring break.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:46.420
To Hawaii.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:48.060
Hawaii...

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:50.560
Did you make this?

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:51.780
It's good.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:41.080
This is the real thing.

00:13:41.080 --> 00:13:43.140
Next episode preview!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.330
Hell and heaven!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.700
Welcome to hell.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.640
Today's Tiger Dojo begins now!

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.010
I-Instructor, isn't something weird?!

00:13:55.010 --> 00:13:57.950
So, only this section is specially animated.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:59.360
Right? Right?

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.690
No wonder it's a special.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:04.020
It's all up to us, right? Instructor?

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.250
It's being animated!

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:08.530
Everything's free to move at will.

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.460
Next episode: Saber at Work.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.490
Look forward to it!

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:13.310
Freedom!
